Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许会死\N{\rEng}I might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:08.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很可能会死\N{\rEng}I very likely will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不求活着\N{\rEng}I'm not asking to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您让我赎罪了\N{\rEng}You've given me redemption,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不再惧怕死亡\N{\rEng}and it's that which makes me no longer fear death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕的\N{\rEng}What I fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无用之死\N{\rEng}is a fruitless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要求的\N{\rEng}What I ask for...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在您给了我那么多之后\N{\rEng}after you have given me so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是使命\N{\rEng}...is purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒  鸡蛋薄煎饼  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}Wakey, wakey, eggs pancakey, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说声谢谢吗\N{\rEng}No thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说声好棒吗\N{\rEng}No "Yay!"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这煎饼是我亲手做的\N{\rEng}These cakes are made from scratch by yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用了山顶寨的纯正高粱\N{\rEng}I used genuine Hilltop sorghum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自碾磨的\N{\rEng}Milled it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\rEng}You -- You -- You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这托盘上爱意满满呢  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}There is a lot of love on this tray, Gregory,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我想表达对你的爱\N{\rEng}because I wanted to express love to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你做了正确的事\N{\rEng}'Cause you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你  如果山顶寨有什么不对劲\N{\rEng}I told you if things started to feel hinky at the Hilltop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就来找我\N{\rEng}to come see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我按你说的做了\N{\rEng}A-And I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫不犹豫\N{\rEng}With zero hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你按我的指示\N{\rEng}You went to the satellite outpost
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了卫星站\N{\rEng}as I instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是了不起啊\N{\rEng}Which was incredibly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经跟我说过了\N{\rEng}You told me that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\rEng}I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三次了\N{\rEng}Three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  你来找我了\N{\rEng}Listen, you came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我已经离开了\N{\rEng}And though I was already away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去处理内乱的事\N{\rEng}dealing with that... rank betrayal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你不知道\N{\rEng}which was unknown to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我的确不知道\N{\rEng}Oh, indeed, it was unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确不知道\N{\rEng}It was, indeed, unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等了我\N{\rEng}And you waited for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我想跟你说\N{\rEng}'Cause I wanted to tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山顶寨  亚历山大和神之国的事\N{\rEng}well, Hilltop and Alexandria, the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你那时候在亚历山大已经知道这事了  对吧\N{\rEng}But you were finding out at that point in Alexandria, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈里  你不用一遍又一遍地解释\N{\rEng}Gregory, you don't need to explain yourself over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\rEng}Hear me when I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你  你做了正确的事\N{\rEng}I'm telling you, you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一步都对\N{\rEng}Every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么带我来这里\N{\rEng}Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你来这里\N{\rEng}I brought you here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我们如今濒临绝境\N{\rEng}because we now stand on the precipice of greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你可以解决问题\N{\rEng}You said you could solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是今天了  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}Today's the day, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用我的爱填满肚子\N{\rEng}You fill your belly up with my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后去解决问题\N{\rEng}and then you solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Aye, aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我\N{\rEng}Well, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先我想说\N{\rEng}I'd just like to start by saying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢今天邀请我来\N{\rEng}thank you for having me here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根  我就和你直说了\N{\rEng}Negan, let me lay this down straight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些我全懂\N{\rEng}I know how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管理资源和人口\N{\rEng}negotiating the slippery, steep terrain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常微妙而难以处理的事\N{\rEng}of managing resources and the population
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还有可怕的"未"\N{\rEng}and the big, scary U.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.07,0:05:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该知道那指什么  就是"未知情况"\N{\rEng}which you might know, it's called the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我这话是认真的\N{\rEng}Listen, I-I mean it when I say it --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根  我不比你更喜欢杀人\N{\rEng}Negan, I don't like killing people any more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢杀人\N{\rEng}I like killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\rEng}Oh. Well, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得重点在于杀死正确的人\N{\rEng}I say it's about killing the right people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在正确的时间杀死正确的人...\N{\rEng}So, you kill the right people at the right time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都水到渠成\N{\rEng}everything falls into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都开心\N{\rEng}Everybody's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然其中一部分人会更开心一些\N{\rEng}Well, some people more than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你杀了一个\N{\rEng}But you kill one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能拯救上百个\N{\rEng}and you could be saving hundreds more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是我们的使命\N{\rEng}And that is what we are all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拯救人们\N{\rEng}We save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...\N{\rEng}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们才自称"救世军"\N{\rEng}That's why you're called the -- the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去抽根烟\N{\rEng}Gonna grab a smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在吗\N{\rEng}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想听这些吗\N{\rEng}You don't want to hear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要听\N{\rEng}Don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我该去哪  该做什么  我自会落实\N{\rEng}Tell me where to go and what to do, I'll make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚刚讲到哪了  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}Where were we, Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了...\N{\rEng}Oh, that's right --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚在和我说你不喜欢杀人\N{\rEng}you were telling me that you don't like to kill people,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我说我喜欢...\N{\rEng}and I was saying that I do --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要情势所需\N{\rEng}under the right circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们...我们所处的\N{\rEng}Well, this -- this situation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...这个情况\N{\rEng}that we -- we find ourselves in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...这个冲突...\N{\rEng}this -- this conflict...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以把它扼杀在摇篮里\N{\rEng}I can stop it ?before it even gets started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  就这样\N{\rEng}I mean, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找我的人  告诉他们\N{\rEng}I go to my people, and I -- I tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你们走上这条...\N{\rEng}if -- if you're joining with this --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不正确的道路\N{\rEng}this misled crusade,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就不再是山顶寨的居民了\N{\rEng}you're no longer citizens of the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们出去自生自灭吧\N{\rEng}You're out on your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是他们的领袖吗\N{\rEng}You're still their guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还听你的吗  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}They still listen to you, Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有权放逐他们吗\N{\rEng}Can you exile people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山顶寨是我的地盘\N{\rEng}The Hilltop is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我依旧是他们的领袖\N{\rEng}I'm still the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直是他们的领袖\N{\rEng}I've always been the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.87,0:08:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你还是他们的领袖\N{\rEng}If you're still the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你确实一直是他们的领袖\N{\rEng}if, indeed, you have always been the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你他妈为什么会不知道那个寡妇\N{\rEng}then why the hell didn't you know about the widow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领着一队你的人\N{\rEng}leading an army of your people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在亚历山大偷袭了我\N{\rEng}straight up my ass in Alexandria?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是怎么想的吗  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}You know what I think, Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你就是根墙头草\N{\rEng}I think you're playing both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你是个虚伪的政客\N{\rEng}I think you are a thin-dicked politician
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着那副虚伪的嘴脸两头讨好\N{\rEng}threading the needle with your thin, thin dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底听你的话是正确的选择呢\N{\rEng}Now, is listening to you the right way to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是此时此地干点别的事更正确呢\N{\rEng}or is it the right place and time for something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  我没想那么做\N{\rEng}No, no. Not trying to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不...\N{\rEng}No, not --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到他们开始行动\N{\rEng}I was -- wasn't aware of things
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才意识到发生了什么\N{\rEng}until they were already in -- in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我半点没有犹豫\N{\rEng}N-No hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从头到尾都是忠诚的\N{\rEng}Allegiance, right there, the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是...在我知道之前我一直不知情\N{\rEng}I just -- I-I didn't know until I-I knew, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈里\N{\rEng}Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\rEng}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你得让尼根相信你\N{\rEng}Now make Negan believe you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山顶寨是我的底盘\N{\rEng}The Hilltop is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让狐狸钻进了鸡窝\N{\rEng}I let a fox into my hen house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和她的人利用了我慷慨的天性\N{\rEng}She and her people took advantage of my generous nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在明白了  我会弥补的\N{\rEng}I see that now, and I will fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我们摆好阵势过去\N{\rEng}If we go in with the right stage picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展示出我们强大的势力\N{\rEng}a thick and veiny show of force
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在格雷戈里发号施令时为他做后盾\N{\rEng}surrounding Gregory when he lays down the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得事情就能回归正轨了\N{\rEng}I think things go back to copacetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如他们不听话  我们就当场行动\N{\rEng}If they don't, we take a flyer on the place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有人都杀了\N{\rEng}and kill everyone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这计划是很不幸\N{\rEng}Unfortunate play,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其他社区会得到警告\N{\rEng}but the other communities will get the message,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们能维持平衡\N{\rEng}and we achieve equilibrium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A计划\N{\rEng}Plan A.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B计划\N{\rEng}Plan B --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人是资源\N{\rEng}People are a resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆在桌面上的利益\N{\rEng}Money on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人是我们建立一切的基础\N{\rEng}People are the foundation of what we are building here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈以为你在跟谁说话\N{\rEng}Who the hell do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞错了我们是谁吗\N{\rEng}Are you confused about who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞错了谁是老大吗\N{\rEng}Are you confused about who is in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们倒退了吗  西蒙\N{\rEng}Are we backsliding, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你告诉我  我们没倒退吧\N{\rEng}Please, ?tell me we're not backsliding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没倒退\N{\rEng}We're not backsliding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是重大事件  也是紧要关头\N{\rEng}This is a pronounced event and a fragile moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是了\N{\rEng}Hell, yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得取得全胜\N{\rEng}We need to win it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:11:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A计划\N{\rEng}Plan A
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是活捉瑞克  寡妇和混球国王\N{\rEng}is taking the Rick, the widow, and King Assface alive
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以非常非常公开\N{\rEng}and making them dead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和有效的方式处死他们\N{\rEng}in a very, very public and instructive way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要用最不人道的方式杀死正确的人\N{\rEng}We kill the right people in the wrongest way possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼他们全部看着\N{\rEng}and we make them all watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该派我们的人出去吗\N{\rEng}Should we get our people out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列队  扫射他们\N{\rEng}Line 'em up, light 'em up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有土气的装甲\N{\rEng}They got some sort of hillbilly armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样只会浪费子弹\N{\rEng}We'd just be wasting metal on metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭发射器还在库里  所以\N{\rEng}And the RPG is stashed at the cache, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去聊聊\N{\rEng}let's have ourselves a little chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙  带上你的新朋友\N{\rEng}Simon, bring your new little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许需要他讲几句\N{\rEng}We may need him to say some words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈里  该你上了\N{\rEng}Gregory, you're on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里  窗口各安排三人\N{\rEng}Gary, put three and three in the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们别轻举妄动\N{\rEng}Tell them to stay the hell down till we need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活见鬼了\N{\rEng}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈呀\N{\rEng}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚在开会\N{\rEng}I was in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真方便\N{\rEng}Well, that's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一整梭子呢\N{\rEng}This one still has a full clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪没有任何意义\N{\rEng}There wasn't any point in firing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我子弹不够多\N{\rEng}I didn't have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  但你本可以抵抗到死的  娇气孩子\N{\rEng}Yeah, but you could've gone down fighting, you big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是逗逗你  和你打打趣\N{\rEng}I'm just pulling your dick, breakin' your balls a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好  聪明之举\N{\rEng}You done good. Smart play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来扶你坐好吧\N{\rEng}Let's get you properly on your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你朋友瑞克是个混蛋\N{\rEng}Your friend Rick is an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是个混蛋\N{\rEng}You're an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是\N{\rEng}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他会害死别人的\N{\rEng}But he's gonna get people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被你杀死\N{\rEng}By you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀了寡妇和老公和红毛\N{\rEng}See, I killed the widow's husband and the ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我没害死他们\N{\rEng}But I didn't get them killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害死他们的是你朋友瑞克\N{\rEng}That was your boy Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区别很大\N{\rEng}Big difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到你停下救格雷戈里那个蠢货了\N{\rEng}You know, I saw you stop for that Gregory idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那里  你目睹了一切\N{\rEng}You were there. ?You saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了他说的话\N{\rEng}You heard his little speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么停下救那个胡子混蛋\N{\rEng}Why would you stop for that bearded prick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕的是无用之死\N{\rEng}What I fear is a fruitless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  你在说笑吧\N{\rEng}Jesus Christ. ?You got to be kiddin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他出卖了你这怪人\N{\rEng}He split on your creepy little ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你生命的意义是拯救那个白痴吗\N{\rEng}The point of your life would be saving that dickhead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}That wouldn't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那样做一定有别的原因\N{\rEng}There had to be some reason I did what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这就是原因\N{\rEng}Maybe this is the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\rEng}I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来听你忏悔的\N{\rEng}I'm here to take your confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在化工厂的人\N{\rEng}Your people back in the chemical plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们赢了吗\N{\rEng}Did you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人赢\N{\rEng}No one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈什么意思\N{\rEng}The hell's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈什么意思\N{\rEng}The hell's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都死了\N{\rEng}Everyone's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放屁\N{\rEng}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没活人了吗  就剩你了\N{\rEng}There's no one else? You're the only one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.73,0:18:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我\N{\rEng}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王\N{\rEng}The King.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斧子男\N{\rEng}The axe man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有个短发疯婆子\N{\rEng}And a short-haired psycho lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们干的\N{\rEng}You did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的人\N{\rEng}My people...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的人\N{\rEng}your people...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死了\N{\rEng}they're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\rEng}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要死了\N{\rEng}me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以等等\N{\rEng}We can wait it out a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.99,0:19:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的人能否想出什么办法\N{\rEng}see if my people can figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一件事可以确定\N{\rEng}One thing that is sure as ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我的人认为我死了\N{\rEng}if my people think I'm dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面会死很多人的\N{\rEng}a lot of folks are gonna die in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\rEng}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没什么好忏悔的\N{\rEng}I don't have shit to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了我偶尔会坐在你那位子上\N{\rEng}Except maybe the fact that I rubbed one out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撸一发让自己冷静冷静\N{\rEng}right where you're sitting just to calm down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你\N{\rEng}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么当神父\N{\rEng}Why'd you become a priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱上帝  爱人们\N{\rEng}I love God, and I love people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想把他们联系起来\N{\rEng}I wanted to bring them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮人们度过难关\N{\rEng}To help people through their difficult times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮他们克服弱点\N{\rEng}To help them through their weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\rEng}Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.69,0:20:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明明是我的责任\N{\rEng}That's my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也喜欢帮人们克服弱点\N{\rEng}I like to help people through their weaknesses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子一直在用不同的方法那样做\N{\rEng}Been doing it one way or another my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么帮人们的\N{\rEng}How do you help people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道里面的人为什么会死吗\N{\rEng}You want to know why people are gonna start dying in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我没在那里阻止\N{\rEng}Because I'm not there to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能假设尼根已经死了\N{\rEng}We have to assume Negan's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是尼根\N{\rEng}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且就我理解  这屋里的每个人都是\N{\rEng}And as I understand it, everyone in this room is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道现在大家很紧张\N{\rEng}Now, I realize there's a lot of stress in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是确认一下\N{\rEng}but just to clarify,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得自己不是尼根吗  瑞吉娜\N{\rEng}are you saying you're someone else, Regina?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该派栅栏小队出去\N{\rEng}We should send the fence crew out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再叫上几个人\N{\rEng}Grab a few others,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-四十个工人  背靠背站着  -不\N{\rEng}- we get 40 workers, standing back to back. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们拿着管子出去\N{\rEng}We get them out with pipes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.07,0:21:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清出一条路\N{\rEng}they clear a path...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.18,0:21:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-够一小队人走...  -行不通\N{\rEng}- just enough for a small team... - Inadequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的数量行不通\N{\rEng}The numbers you suggest aren't adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.57,0:22:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照我们周围的实时尸群密度\N{\rEng}Given the current S.R.O. density of the herd surrounding us,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四十个工人装备近战武器  组成此阵型\N{\rEng}40 workers armed with melee weapons in the formation you propose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几分钟内就会被包围歼灭  \N{\rEng}would be overcome, closed in on, and macked upon within a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  没错\N{\rEng}Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.05,0:22:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用工人分散行尸注意力\N{\rEng}We use the workers as a distraction
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一小队人穿过尸群\N{\rEng}to get a small team past the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可以去警告哨站\N{\rEng}They can warn the outposts
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后带回"胖女人"\N{\rEng}and then come back with the Fat Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个方案不仅成功机会渺茫\N{\rEng}Add to the approach's slim chances of success,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可能导致人心惶惶\N{\rEng}it's likely the play would lead to widespread unrest,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在食物与燃料已趋于匮乏时\N{\rEng}pitting the workers against the soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑起工人与士兵对立\N{\rEng}when we're running out of food and fuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.07,0:22:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会打乱原本已不牢靠的现状\N{\rEng}upsetting our already precarious apple cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.15,0:22:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许只要把你扔出去\N{\rEng}Maybe all we need to do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能解决一切问题呢  尤金\N{\rEng}is put you out there, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这样能激励咱们的智多星\N{\rEng}Maybe it would motivate the answer man
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.59,0:22:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想出解决方法\N{\rEng}to come up with a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.67,0:22:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞吉娜  他说的没错\N{\rEng}Regina, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工人有人数优势\N{\rEng}The workers have the numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.40,0:22:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得拉拢他们\N{\rEng}and we need to keep them on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得控制住他们\N{\rEng}We need to keep them in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我们有几个人能逃出去  甚至清空尸群\N{\rEng}Even if we get a few of ours out and somehow clear the crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也早在建筑四周布满狙击手\N{\rEng}they have snipers ?all around the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.37,0:23:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在  我们先处理另一个问题\N{\rEng}So right now, let's deal with the other part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这屋里的某人  得为外面的事负责\N{\rEng}Someone in here made everything out there happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们正在针对亚历山大的反叛\N{\rEng}We're having our little crisis-management meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召开危机处理会议时\N{\rEng}about the rebellion in Alexandria,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们三个哨站领队齐聚于此\N{\rEng}us three outpost heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他们就选在此时对我们动手\N{\rEng}and that's when they pile this crap on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偏在这时候将我们封锁\N{\rEng}That's when they cut us off?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.29,0:23:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们无所不见  无所不知\N{\rEng}They knows all and sees all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人不一定要用枪\N{\rEng}Sometimes it doesn't take a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需要一个叛徒\N{\rEng}The right kind of rat...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动一张嘴  就能害死一帮人\N{\rEng}can kill plenty of people with just some talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但死的不会是我们\N{\rEng}But it's not gonna be us,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.38,0:23:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不一定得是工人们\N{\rEng}and it doesn't have to be the workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.95,0:24:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德怀特  你要认清现实\N{\rEng}Dwight, you got to face reality here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  西蒙  我们坚守属于我们的\N{\rEng}No, Simon, we keep what's ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个也不放弃\N{\rEng}and we don't give up a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们杀出重围\N{\rEng}We get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.72,0:24:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再听见你们俩\N{\rEng}And I don't want to hear backbiting
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说些背后伤人或是抱怨的话\N{\rEng}or pissing or moaning from you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.74,0:24:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有意见  冲着我来\N{\rEng}You got a problem with that, come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.49,0:24:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你若不能带领救世军离开这儿  换我来\N{\rEng}You can't lead the Saviors out of here, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.03,0:24:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  好孩子\N{\rEng}Yes, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.23,0:24:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且\N{\rEng}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.53,0:24:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会揪出害我们的那个人渣\N{\rEng}we're gonna find that subhuman coward that did this to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:24:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要当着所有人面\N{\rEng}and we're gonna kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花上漫长的几天\N{\rEng}very slowly in front of everyone here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.56,0:25:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢地宰了他\N{\rEng}over the course of a few very long days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.30,0:25:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会议颇有成效  各位\N{\rEng}Good meeting, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.41,0:25:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起让今天成为美好的一天吧\N{\rEng}Now let's make today the best today it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.22,0:26:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于你在会议中的支持\N{\rEng}I'd like to express my sincere thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.77,0:26:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想表达诚挚的谢意\N{\rEng}for your support at the recent confab.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.81,0:26:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我竭尽我所能保持低调\N{\rEng}I was doing my level best to stay fully on the DL,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.14,0:26:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有时协调口与脑的神经失效\N{\rEng}but sometimes the mouth-brain neuronal connection experience
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.76,0:26:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猝不及防说错了话\N{\rEng}is a misfire, and foot met mouth at an unavoidable velocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.53,0:26:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在屋里说得没错\N{\rEng}You were right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.16,0:26:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不说  我也会说\N{\rEng}If you didn't say it, I would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.35,0:26:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为表示感谢\N{\rEng}As a token of my appreciation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.57,0:26:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你带了我私藏的优质小黄瓜\N{\rEng}I brought you some primo cukes from my private stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.35,0:26:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你能收下  它象征我\N{\rEng}I'd like you to accept these as a sign of my faith
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.03,0:26:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚信我们能脱离困境的信心[谐音腌黄瓜]\N{\rEng}that we will, in fact, find a way out of this pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.61,0:26:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故意双关的\N{\rEng}Pun intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你来一趟\N{\rEng}Thanks for stopping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.43,0:26:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  那个...\N{\rEng}Hold up. It's --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.21,0:26:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没干\N{\rEng}It's still wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.93,0:26:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自制的吗\N{\rEng}You DIY'd these?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.76,0:26:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.45,0:27:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全能理解\N{\rEng}I fully understand the reasoning
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.69,0:27:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在各种叛变情况下\N{\rEng}behind yours truly being prime suspect
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.31,0:27:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀疑本人是头号嫌疑犯的逻辑\N{\rEng}in pretty much any Benedict Arnold type situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.54,0:27:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此情况下\N{\rEng}And in light of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.67,0:27:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴有你为我殿后\N{\rEng}I'm doubly grateful to have you watching my six.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.34,0:27:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前在屋里说得对\N{\rEng}You were right back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.94,0:28:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外我什么都没说\N{\rEng}I didn't say anything more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你灾变前帮助过弱者吗\N{\rEng}You helped the weak before this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.72,0:28:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\rEng}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.34,0:28:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不教他们\N{\rEng}You don't show them the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.21,0:28:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就会变成渣滓\N{\rEng}well, they turn out like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小混蛋变成大混蛋\N{\rEng}Little assholes become great big ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以得教他们\N{\rEng}so you show them the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.64,0:28:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成年人也需要\N{\rEng}Adults, they need it, too --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.32,0:28:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府  法律  宗教  罪孽\N{\rEng}the government, laws, religion, guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.12,0:28:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生来就是弱者\N{\rEng}People are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.23,0:28:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人吗\N{\rEng}Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.65,0:28:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\rEng}Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是弱者\N{\rEng}You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.74,0:28:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滥杀无辜\N{\rEng}Killing the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.87,0:28:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对也不对\N{\rEng}Right and goddamn wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.16,0:29:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确是弱者  但是"滥杀无辜"\N{\rEng}I'm weak, but me "Killing the innocent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是原因  小加\N{\rEng}That ain't why, Gabey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.93,0:29:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再等一会\N{\rEng}We'll wait a little bit longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.54,0:29:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我的人能不能缓过来\N{\rEng}see if my people can pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.01,0:29:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么是弱者\N{\rEng}Why are you weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.60,0:29:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问错了\N{\rEng}That's the wrong question.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.57,0:29:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该问我如何弱\N{\rEng}It is how I am weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.99,0:29:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上  我也很强\N{\rEng}You see, the thing is, I am also strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.31,0:29:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都是综合体\N{\rEng}Everyone is a mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.07,0:29:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以用你的弱点来激发你的长处\N{\rEng}You can use your weaknesses to drive your strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.93,0:29:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我显然他妈非常强\N{\rEng}and obviously, I am strong as shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.47,0:29:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我占领了这里\N{\rEng}I took this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.13,0:29:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里本来无法无天  只有一群混蛋\N{\rEng}and it was a damn free-for-all -- a loose confederation of assholes,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是一群禽兽\N{\rEng}an army made up of gangs of animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.01,0:30:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将他们整合起来\N{\rEng}and I brought it all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.83,0:30:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前的领袖\N{\rEng}The last guy that was in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.86,0:30:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁都没管过\N{\rEng}he wasn't in charge of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.07,0:30:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让人变弱  我不会\N{\rEng}He allowed people to be weak. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.63,0:30:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让他们变强  也让这个世界变强\N{\rEng}I make them strong, which makes this world strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.41,0:30:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会明白的  小加\N{\rEng}You're gonna see, Gabey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.75,0:30:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让你成为我新的培养对象\N{\rEng}See, I'm gonna make you my new special project.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.59,0:30:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让你也变强\N{\rEng}Gonna make you nice and strong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.75,0:30:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要找到属于你的特殊使命\N{\rEng}We're gonna find your special purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.20,0:30:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定会的\N{\rEng}Hell yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.21,0:30:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很强\N{\rEng}I'm strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.73,0:30:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀过人\N{\rEng}I've killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.55,0:30:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时也在卫星站\N{\rEng}I was at the Satellite Station. I was a part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.60,0:30:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你趁我的人在睡梦中时杀了他们\N{\rEng}Then you killed my people while they were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.81,0:30:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你  一脸得意的样子\N{\rEng}Well, look at you, swinging your dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.44,0:30:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  小加\N{\rEng}Sure, Gabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那的确很强\N{\rEng}That's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.37,0:31:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我说的不是那个意思\N{\rEng}But that's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.01,0:31:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你如何弱了\N{\rEng}Tell me how you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.22,0:31:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可能活不久了\N{\rEng}We might be dead soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.62,0:31:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能会死\N{\rEng}You may be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.60,0:31:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想在此之前忏悔吗\N{\rEng}Wouldn't you want to confess before all that happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想得到赦免吗\N{\rEng}Wouldn't you want absolution before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.26,0:31:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宽恕\N{\rEng}Forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.16,0:31:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要大声地说出真相\N{\rEng}Costs you nothing more than saying the truth aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.35,0:31:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得你没有什么要忏悔的吗\N{\rEng}You don't think you have anything to confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.05,0:31:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所杀的那些人\N{\rEng}People you've killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀的都是该死之人\N{\rEng}I haven't killed anyone that didn't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些被你当做奴隶的工人\N{\rEng}The workers you treat like slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.25,0:31:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是经济秩序\N{\rEng}It's an economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.99,0:31:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人赢  有人输\N{\rEng}Some people win, some people lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.67,0:31:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没人是奴隶  没人会挨饿\N{\rEng}but no one's a slave, no one's going hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.67,0:31:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前可不是这样\N{\rEng}and you couldn't say that before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.11,0:32:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔跟我们说了你的那些妻子们\N{\rEng}Carl told us about your wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些被迫嫁给你的女人们\N{\rEng}The women you pressure into marrying you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.12,0:32:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些女士都是自己做出的选择\N{\rEng}Every one of those ladies made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.70,0:32:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有第一任吗\N{\rEng}Was there a first?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.25,0:32:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前\N{\rEng}One before all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.99,0:32:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个你答应守护一生\N{\rEng}A wife you promised to have and to hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.41,0:32:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不离不弃的结发妻子\N{\rEng}forsaking all others?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个被你谎言欺骗的妻子\N{\rEng}One you told that lie to?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露西尔  给我力量\N{\rEng}Lucille, give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.31,0:32:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  小加\N{\rEng}All right, Gabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.63,0:32:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人来救我们\N{\rEng}No one's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:33:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你试过了  试了好几次\N{\rEng}You took your shot -- shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.65,0:33:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\rEng}It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.11,0:33:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我一把\N{\rEng}Hey. Give me a hand with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.16,0:33:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.13,0:33:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-拿稳了吗  -好了\N{\rEng}- Got it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.86,0:34:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些可以派上用场了\N{\rEng}We can use these now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\rEng}Well, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.17,0:34:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也没有神之国了\N{\rEng}There ain't no Kingdom no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道接下来该做什么\N{\rEng}We know what we got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.49,0:34:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们炸开救世堂  让行尸涌进去\N{\rEng}We blow open the Sanctuary, let the walkers flood in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.12,0:34:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会投降的\N{\rEng}They'll surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.61,0:34:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会成功的\N{\rEng}It'll be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.24,0:34:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日落前就能结束这一切\N{\rEng}Hell, we could end this by sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面还有工人  不是吗\N{\rEng}They have workers in there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.87,0:34:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有家人\N{\rEng}Families, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有吗\N{\rEng}Are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.08,0:34:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进攻主楼的南面\N{\rEng}We'll hit the south side of the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.23,0:34:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有工人都住在北面\N{\rEng}The workers live in the north side.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.17,0:34:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在行尸来之前就能上楼\N{\rEng}They'll be up the stairs before the walkers even get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.12,0:34:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是他们没上楼呢\N{\rEng}What if they don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.65,0:34:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有些人并不是战士\N{\rEng}There are people in there who aren't fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.95,0:34:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做会改变这点\N{\rEng}Doing this could change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.08,0:34:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会拿起枪  站在救世军那边\N{\rEng}Make them pick up guns and stand by the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.35,0:34:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是救世军不投降\N{\rEng}And if the Saviors don't surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.28,0:35:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许所有人都会与我们战斗\N{\rEng}maybe everyone fights us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.36,0:35:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们已经没有神之国相助了\N{\rEng}And we don't have the Kingdom anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.46,0:35:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能这么做\N{\rEng}We're not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.26,0:35:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你不能这么做\N{\rEng}You ain't doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.59,0:35:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有计划  每个人都要按计划来\N{\rEng}There's a plan, and everyone's sticking to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.79,0:35:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是所有人\N{\rEng}Not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.73,0:35:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有不少我们的人牺牲了  瑞克\N{\rEng}There's a lot of our people that are dead, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.03,0:35:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况变了  老兄\N{\rEng}Things change, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.23,0:35:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全怪尼根和另一个团体\N{\rEng}Negan and that other group, this is on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.74,0:35:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有人死了  是他们的错  不是我们的\N{\rEng}If people die, it's their fault, not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.26,0:35:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达里尔  我们不能这么做\N{\rEng}Daryl, we can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.28,0:35:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还要照顾自己的人\N{\rEng}And we got our own people to look after.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.00,0:35:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能这么做\N{\rEng}We're not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.20,0:35:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我不会让你这么做的\N{\rEng}Hey. I'm not letting you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.27,0:36:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由不得你\N{\rEng}This ain't your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.97,0:36:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.09,0:36:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-达里尔  -起来\N{\rEng}- Daryl! - Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.58,0:37:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有计划\N{\rEng}There's a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.26,0:37:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该执行到底\N{\rEng}We got to see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.96,0:37:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得赢\N{\rEng}We gotta win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.63,0:37:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我们得赢\N{\rEng}Yeah, we gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.79,0:38:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁喉犯规了  混蛋\N{\rEng}Choke hold's illegal, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.26,0:38:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  没错\N{\rEng}Mm-hmm. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.28,0:38:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我得走路了\N{\rEng}Looks like I'm walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.16,0:38:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.97,0:38:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一步结束后我就去和你碰头\N{\rEng}I'll meet you when I'm done with the last play.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.44,0:38:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定要这么做吗\N{\rEng}You sure about doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.92,0:38:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\rEng}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.79,0:39:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有露西尔帮我们抵达救世堂\N{\rEng}We have Lucille to help us get to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.65,0:39:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有那把枪\N{\rEng}We have that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.34,0:39:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该用上\N{\rEng}We should use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.69,0:39:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是  加百利  我们有彼此\N{\rEng}Most importantly, Gabriel, we have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.32,0:39:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人就是资源\N{\rEng}People are a resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.04,0:39:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要能进去  我们就能活下来\N{\rEng}We make it inside, we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.99,0:39:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以冒险一下  抹上内脏\N{\rEng}We can take a chance, we can "Gut up,"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.23,0:39:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假扮行尸  穿过院子\N{\rEng}play dead ones across the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.87,0:39:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者\N{\rEng}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.11,0:39:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以直接杀了你  但这不是我想要的\N{\rEng}Or I can just kill you, but that is not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.62,0:40:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要的是和你合作\N{\rEng}What I want is for you to work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.09,0:40:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我想要的全部\N{\rEng}That is all I ever want.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.36,0:40:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀过人  但这并不是我最大的罪孽\N{\rEng}I've killed before, but that's not my greatest sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.21,0:40:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.66,0:40:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在灾变伊始  我把我的会众关在了教堂门外\N{\rEng}I locked my congregation out of my church when this all just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.47,0:40:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听着他们死去的声音  我退缩了\N{\rEng}I listened to them die... as I cowered.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.45,0:40:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我辜负了他们\N{\rEng}I failed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.99,0:40:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对不起上帝\N{\rEng}I failed God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.44,0:40:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一天\N{\rEng}And every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.32,0:40:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都努力赎罪\N{\rEng}I work to lessen that failure,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.61,0:40:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做一个有作用和有使命的人\N{\rEng}to be of service and purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.67,0:40:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我向你保证你会得到宽恕  \N{\rEng}Now I offer you the assurance of a pardon,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.77,0:40:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忏悔和赦免\N{\rEng}penance, and absolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.78,0:40:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会跟你走\N{\rEng}I will go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.25,0:41:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会向你展示  人人平等共同努力\N{\rEng}I will show you that working together as equals
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.36,0:41:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是得到恩惠和享有未来的\N{\rEng}is the only true way to grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.75,0:41:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一正确道路\N{\rEng}to a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.20,0:41:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你忏悔  我就这样做\N{\rEng}I will do this... if you confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.83,0:41:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  小加\N{\rEng}Jesus, Gabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.98,0:41:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做的那事\N{\rEng}What you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.65,0:41:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可怕  懦弱  没骨气\N{\rEng}that is some horrible, cowardly, spineless shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.87,0:41:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我猜忏悔就该这样  对吧\N{\rEng}But I guess that's what a confession's supposed to be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.16,0:41:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的第一任妻子是真正的妻子\N{\rEng}My first wife was a real wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.83,0:41:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我唯一真正的妻子\N{\rEng}My only real wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.37,0:41:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到死亡拆散我们\N{\rEng}Till death did us part.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是灾变前\N{\rEng}It was before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.18,0:42:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我骗了她  出去乱搞\N{\rEng}I lied to her, I screwed around on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.20,0:42:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来她病了\N{\rEng}And she was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.80,0:42:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走的时候\N{\rEng}And when she went...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.86,0:42:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走的时候  灾变刚开始\N{\rEng}When she went, it was during this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.00,0:42:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对她下不了手\N{\rEng}I couldn't put her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.53,0:42:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我如何弱的\N{\rEng}That is how I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.60,0:42:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我要忏悔的事情\N{\rEng}That is what I will confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.95,0:42:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没错  我们可能等会就死在这了\N{\rEng}Because, yeah, maybe we do bite the big one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.67,0:42:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被宽恕了\N{\rEng}You're forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.67,0:42:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.59,0:42:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿着你的枪吧\N{\rEng}You can keep your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.22,0:43:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惨了小加  我们要冒着进嘴巴的风险\N{\rEng}Sucks, Gabe, but it looks like we got to risk eating it...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.28,0:43:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涂上它\N{\rEng}...by eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.94,0:43:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\rEng}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.47,0:43:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前用内脏伪装过吗\N{\rEng}You ever done this trick with the guts before?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.20,0:43:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.42,0:43:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是些腐烂恶臭的内脏\N{\rEng}These are putrid, decaying organs,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.79,0:43:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸的血  大小便\N{\rEng}dead blood, piss, and shit
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.52,0:43:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在弗吉尼亚州的阳光下暴晒发酵\N{\rEng}that have been cooking all day in the Virginian sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.19,0:43:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的人没有因此染病的吗\N{\rEng}None of your people ?ever gotten sick from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.95,0:43:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来自乔治亚州\N{\rEng}We're from Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.57,0:43:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这群幸运的混球\N{\rEng}Look at you lucky shits.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.09,0:44:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们制造点噪音\N{\rEng}Let's make some noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.27,0:45:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.73,0:45:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天应该从我的哨站运送物资\N{\rEng}Now, we were due for a delivery today from my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.87,0:45:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侦查员什么都没看到\N{\rEng}Spotters haven't seen anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.95,0:45:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  运输卡车如果看到情况\N{\rEng}Yeah, the transport truck would've turned around,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.65,0:45:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该会往回开的\N{\rEng}seeing the state of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.62,0:45:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是路上什么车也没有\N{\rEng}but nothing's come up any of the roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.49,0:45:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化工厂哨站不会错过送货的\N{\rEng}Chem outpost doesn't miss deliveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.61,0:45:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是发生了什么\N{\rEng}Something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.65,0:45:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个瑞克动手了\N{\rEng}That Rick guy happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.67,0:45:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的哨站被袭击了...\N{\rEng}Our outposts are getting hit while --
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.54,0:45:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.46,0:45:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们上楼了\N{\rEng}They're coming up the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.93,0:45:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸吗\N{\rEng}Walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.57,0:45:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工人\N{\rEng}The workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.02,0:46:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说不怕吃枪子\N{\rEng}They said we'd have to shoot them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.46,0:46:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工人只能待在一楼\N{\rEng}Workers are designated to stay on the ground level.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈呀\N{\rEng}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.54,0:46:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工人的特定活动区域\N{\rEng}Specifically, their activity is constrained
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.10,0:46:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有工厂车间和室外庭园\N{\rEng}to the factory floor and the outdoor gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.91,0:46:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面太热了\N{\rEng}It's too hot down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.94,0:46:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们绝不会去外面\N{\rEng}And we sure as hell ain't going outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.40,0:46:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们什么时候修好电机\N{\rEng}When you gonna fix the power?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.94,0:46:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要修\N{\rEng}It doesn't need fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.80,0:46:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在节省燃料\N{\rEng}We're conserving fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.64,0:46:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是同舟共济\N{\rEng}Mm? It's a shared sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.32,0:46:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们现在开始同舟共济了\N{\rEng}Oh. You're sharing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.40,0:46:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种语气我忍不了\N{\rEng}That sort of tone is not gonna work for me. - Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.98,0:46:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听好\N{\rEng}everyone, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.22,0:46:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能挺过去的\N{\rEng}Look, we're gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.65,0:46:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗  我们只是需要更多时间\N{\rEng}Okay? We just need some more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.96,0:47:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要更多水\N{\rEng}We need some more water!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.58,0:47:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面有老人孩子\N{\rEng}There are young people, old people!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水也要定量分配\N{\rEng}We're rationing that out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.47,0:47:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们工作  你们保护我们\N{\rEng}We work, you protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.40,0:47:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是说好的\N{\rEng}That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.33,0:47:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-本该是这样的  -对啊\N{\rEng}- That's how it was supposed to work. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.62,0:47:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要水\N{\rEng}We need water!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.76,0:47:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有救我们出去的计划吗\N{\rEng}Do you have a plan for getting us out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.53,0:47:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听到首领的话了\N{\rEng}You heard the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.13,0:47:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都必须回车间\N{\rEng}You all need to get back to the factory floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.15,0:47:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根在哪\N{\rEng}Where's Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.69,0:47:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\rEng}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.22,0:47:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答问题\N{\rEng}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.28,0:47:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人立刻回车间\N{\rEng}Everyone has to return to the factory floor now!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.37,0:47:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪也不去\N{\rEng}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.35,0:47:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要在这点上纠正你\N{\rEng}I need to correct you on that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.74,0:47:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-尼根在哪  -有枪\N{\rEng}- Where's Negan?! - Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.06,0:47:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\rEng}I am Negan!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.70,0:47:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有人想吃枪子吗\N{\rEng}Anyone else want a bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.73,0:47:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有人吗\N{\rEng}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.73,0:48:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞吉娜\N{\rEng}Ah, Regina.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.99,0:48:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样做\N{\rEng}Now, why'd you have to go and do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.15,0:48:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你们很多人都以为我死了\N{\rEng}I am guessing that a lot of you fine folks thought I was dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.90,0:48:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被咬碎吞了  死不见尸\N{\rEng}chewed up, never to be crapped out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.48,0:48:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我提醒一下你们我他妈是谁\N{\rEng}Well, here's a little refresher on who the hell I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.23,0:48:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿皮夹克  持露西尔\N{\rEng}I wear a leather jacket, I have Lucille,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.00,0:48:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有金刚不坏之蛋\N{\rEng}and my nutsack is made of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.94,0:48:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没享完福之前  我绝不会轻易死去\N{\rEng}I am not dying until I am damn good and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.90,0:48:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  失陪了\N{\rEng}Now, if you'll all excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.87,0:48:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我急需吃个三明治  冲个澡\N{\rEng}I am in deep need of a sandwich, a shower,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.15,0:48:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受一下弗兰基在旧金山学的\N{\rEng}and some of that, uh, wilting lion orchid
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.34,0:48:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垂狮兰泰式深层组织按摩\N{\rEng}deep-tissue shit that Frankie learned in San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.18,0:49:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼  我说不定会同时做\N{\rEng}Hell, I might do it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.73,0:49:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在那之后  我们要处理一些严肃的事\N{\rEng}But after that, we have some serious business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.02,0:49:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如跟我的得力手下谈谈\N{\rEng}Like talking to my right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.56,0:49:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须搞清楚\N{\rEng}You see, we got to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.78,0:49:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会发生这种事\N{\rEng}how all this could've happened like it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.18,0:49:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后\N{\rEng}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.48,0:49:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要继续做我们一直做的事\N{\rEng}Well, and then we're gonna get back doing what we have always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.40,0:49:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要拯救人们\N{\rEng}We will save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.62,0:49:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  尼根  感谢上帝有你\N{\rEng}Thank you, Negan. Thank God for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.78,0:49:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我在这里的原因\N{\rEng}And that is why I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.01,0:49:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生们  温柔地带他去二号牢房\N{\rEng}Gentlemen, gently take him to number 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.96,0:49:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温柔地\N{\rEng}Gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好消息是  我搞清楚了\N{\rEng}Good news is, I figured out
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.34,0:50:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那混蛋的枪是从哪来的\N{\rEng}where that asshole's gun came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.80,0:50:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏消息呢\N{\rEng}And the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.37,0:50:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪是我们的\N{\rEng}They're ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.30,0:50:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从武器库偷的\N{\rEng}Stolen from the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.93,0:50:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工人不可能在我们眼皮底下偷这么多枪\N{\rEng}A worker couldn't have gotten this many guns without us knowing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.78,0:50:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一把都偷不走\N{\rEng}They couldn't have got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.72,0:50:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  是自己人干的  现在依然在干\N{\rEng}No, one of our own did this -- is doing this, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.22,0:50:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我该怎么揪出他  西蒙\N{\rEng}Tell me how we find him, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.79,0:50:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们查出军火的失窃时间\N{\rEng}We...find when the munitions went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.38,0:50:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过这个  查出失窃过程\N{\rEng}Through that, we get an idea of the how,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.38,0:50:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但愿能牵出内鬼是谁\N{\rEng}which hopefully leads us right to who.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.51,0:50:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但先查时间\N{\rEng}But we start with when.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.43,0:51:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机灵鬼博士\N{\rEng}Dr. Smartypants.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.98,0:52:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个很大的机遇\N{\rEng}Big, big chance here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.43,0:52:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是能解决了外面臭烘烘的行尸\N{\rEng}You solve this thing with the bad-smelling convention outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.65,0:52:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让你非常非常开心的\N{\rEng}I will make you very, very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.19,0:52:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但即使你尽了全力\N{\rEng}But even if you try your best
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.16,0:52:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我也知道你尽了全力\N{\rEng}and I know you try your best
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.07,0:52:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依然想不出什么方法\N{\rEng}but you don't figure something out...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.28,0:52:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证  我会给你个痛快\N{\rEng}I assure you, I will kill you quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.18,0:52:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省的你看到食物和水耗尽后\N{\rEng}so you don't have to see all the awful, horrific things
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.61,0:52:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里变成恐怖的人间地狱\N{\rEng}that are gonna go down here when we run out of food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.47,0:52:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\rEng}What I'm saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.05,0:52:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样  我都会帮你\N{\rEng}is that I got your back either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.39,0:52:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会帮我吗\N{\rEng}You got mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.06,0:53:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加百利  我是尤金·伯特\N{\rEng}Gabriel, it's Eugene Porter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.39,0:53:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金·伯特博士\N{\rEng}Dr. Eugene Porter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.71,0:53:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾是邻居  旅伴\N{\rEng}We were, uh...neighbors, traveling companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.99,0:53:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起吃过狗肉  所以\N{\rEng}We've eaten dog together, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.82,0:53:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜也算是一辈子的交情\N{\rEng}I imagine that joins us in some manner for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.75,0:53:36.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来正式欢迎你来到救世堂的\N{\rEng}I'm here to formally welcome you to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.76,0:53:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为目前被围  热出来的痱子\N{\rEng}In our current state of siege, the prickly heat alone
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.83,0:53:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会导致你对这里留下坏印象\N{\rEng}might be enough to turn you off the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.58,0:53:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我觉得自己有责任\N{\rEng}so I took it upon myself
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.83,0:53:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你带来一些欢迎物品\N{\rEng}to...bring you some welcome-wagon items
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.36,0:53:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能减轻你的痛苦\N{\rEng}in hopes of providing some relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.12,0:53:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加百利\N{\rEng}Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.04,0:54:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须立刻看卡森医生2.0\N{\rEng}You need to see Dr. Carson 2.0 A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.72,0:54:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}I d-- I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.23,0:54:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我在这里的原因\N{\rEng}That's why I'm here. That's why --
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.22,0:54:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们在这里的原因\N{\rEng}It's the reason we're here, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.34,0:54:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得...\N{\rEng}I think it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.74,0:54:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡森...是玛姬的医生\N{\rEng}Carson...is Maggie's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.99,0:54:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须救他出去\N{\rEng}W-We have to get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.24,0:54:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须救他出去\N{\rEng}We have to get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.08,0:54:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须救他...\N{\rEng}We have to get him out of...
